I return home.
The house is quiet now.
The weather outside is very humid.
But the fan is running in the room.
I put my bag on the bed.
I open the bag.
I look at the new cotton shirt.
The colour of the shirt is very beautiful.
I want to wear it right now.
I put on the new shirt.
But it is not right.
The shirt is very small at the shoulders.
I cannot move my arms properly.
I look in the mirror.
This shirt is too small for me.
Compared to this, I need a bigger shirt.
I take off the small shirt.
I put it back in the bag.
The receipt is also in the bag itself.
I will go to the shop tomorrow for an exchange.
